2 CONT [https://cbdb.fas.harvard.edu/cbdbapi/person.php?id=12366 '''Yang Xuan''' 楊暄] [12366] The #1 son of Jun [12365], who served in the administration of the Western Wei with its capital at Changan (as did Jun's younger brother Jian [1
2 CONC 2367]). Xuan(2)'s descendants include Hongwu [22493], a zaixiang of Tang Gaozong, Shou [22497], who was a zaixiang of Tang Yizong, and She(2) [22499], who was a zaixiang of Tang Zhaozong. XTS, 71B.43a-44b. — [https://www.geni.com/
2 CONC projects/CBDB-Hartwell-collection/46406 RMH]
