2 CONT [https://cbdb.fas.harvard.edu/cbdbapi/person.php?id=12367 '''Yang Jian''' 楊儉] [12367] The second son of Jun [12365]. He served in the administration of the Western Wei. His first three sons did not hold office and may have died yo
2 CONC ung. The fourth son, Wenen's (not in dataset) only son Anren's (not in dataset) (ancestor of the Mianzhu Yang(2)) and fifth son, Wenwei [22571], had many descendants. Anren's descendants included Hubu shangshu and other high centr
2 CONC al governmental officials, but no zaixiang. Jun's third son, Kuan's [22509] descendants included a zaixiang of Tang Wuzong. XTS, 71B. — [https://www.geni.com/projects/CBDB-Hartwell-collection/46406 RMH]
