1 NOTE {geni:about_me} It's unclear whether Maria was the mother of King Kavidh II of Iran or his wife... Perhaps the mother of King Kavidh was Sheharezade, one of the wives of King Khosro II of Iran. Or perhaps--as the tree here presume
