1 CONT ——— 
1 CONT 1. Had his name changed into Zhe in 677. 
1 CONT 2. Had his name reverted to Xian when he was reinstated as
1 CONT crown prince in October 698. This name became his taboo name
1 CONT when he reascended the throne in 705. 
1 CONT 3. Deposed by his mother Empress Wu. 
1 CONT 4. Restored as Emperor three days after the coup that put an end
1 CONT to his mother's power. 
